### **Prestigious club climbs**

Alpine ascents are the jewel in the crown of our summer programme. Every year we look for high-altitude routes and approachable "four-thousanders" for members who want to try these experiences, guided by their more experienced friends. Thin air, labored breathing and the sound of crampons biting into the snow, in a silent, rarefied atmosphere.

The essence of alpinism, since the days of the English pioneers.

The best reward for everyone: a handshake and a group photo once the summit is reached.

##### **Activities:**

High-altitude ascents in the Alps.
